<tr>
  <td align="left">
    <p style="margin-bottom: 12px">Hi {{candidateName}},</p>
    <p>Congratulations! We're thrilled to inform you that <strong>{{companyName}}</strong> would like to extend an offer for the <strong>{{jobTitle}}</strong> position.</p>
    <p style="font-weight: 700; margin: 24px 0 12px 0;"><strong>Offer Details:</strong></p>
    <ul style="margin: 12px 0; padding-left: 28px;">
      <li style="margin: 8px 0; padding-left: 12px;"><strong>Position:</strong> {{jobTitle}}</li>
      <li style="margin: 8px 0; padding-left: 12px;"><strong>Salary:</strong> {{salaryRange}}</li>
      <li style="margin: 8px 0; padding-left: 12px;text-transform:capitalize !important;"><strong>Location Type:</strong> {{locationType}}</li>
      <li style="margin: 8px 0; padding-left: 12px;"><strong>Employment Type:</strong> {{employmentType}}</li>
    </ul>
    </ul>
    <p style="margin: 24px 0 0 0;">Please review the complete offer letter and respond as soon as possible.</p>
  </td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td align="center" style="padding: 30px 0;">
    <table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width: 320px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <a href="{{offerLetterLink}}" target="_blank" class="button">View Dashboard</a>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td align="left">
    <p style="margin: 24px 0 0 0;">If you have any questions, don't hesitate to reach out to the hiring team.</p>
  </td>
</tr>
 
